;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"option-two\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">Option Two</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Label</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">div</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">RadioGroup</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"composition\">Composition</h2>\n<p>Use the following composition to build a <code>RadioGroup</code>:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"RadioGroup\n├── RadioGroupItem\n└── RadioGroupItem\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>RadioGroup</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── RadioGroupItem</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>└── RadioGroupItem</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>Radio group items with a description using the <code>Field</code> component.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radio-group-description&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"choice-card\">Choice Card</h2>\n<p>Use <code>FieldLabel</code> to wrap the entire <code>Field</code> for a clickable card-style selection.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radio-group-choice-card&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"fieldset\">Fieldset</h2>\n<p>Use <code>FieldSet</code> and <code>FieldLegend</code> to group radio items with a label and description.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radio-group-fieldset&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"disabled\">Disabled</h2>\n<p>Use the <code>isDisabled</code> prop on <code>RadioGroup</code> to disable all items.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radio-group-disabled&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"invalid\">Invalid</h2>\n<p>Use <code>isInvalid</code> on <code>RadioGroupItem</code> and <code>data-invalid</code> on <code>Field</code> to show validation errors.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radio-group-invalid&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"rtl\">RTL</h2>\n<p>To enable RTL support in shadcn/ui, see the <a href=\"/docs/rtl\">RTL configuration guide</a>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;aria-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radio-group-rtl&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;direction&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;rtl&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"api-reference\">API Reference</h2>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://react-aria.adobe.com/RadioGroup#api\">React Aria Radio Group</a> documentation.</p>"
